-- A row of these tables must belong to a brand (0555 gave the old ones
-- theirs). NOT VALID checks every new or changed row without reading the
-- table, so the locks last moments; a later migration validates it and
-- makes the column NOT NULL. The previous version writes no row without a
-- brand to them either.
-- migration-safety: no code path writes these tables without brand_id (traced over the whole test suite, 0554)

